questions.stem:
$$
 I=\displaystyle\lim_{x\to+\infty}\frac{x^{2}\mathrm{e}^{2x}}{1+x^{2}\left(\mathrm{e}^{x}+1\right)^{2}}
$$

questions.answer:
分子分母同除以 $x^{2}\mathrm{e}^{2x}$：
$$
I=\lim_{x\to+\infty}\frac{1}{\frac{1}{x^{2}\mathrm{e}^{2x}}+\frac{\left(\mathrm{e}^{x}+1\right)^{2}}{\mathrm{e}^{2x}}}
=\lim_{x\to+\infty}\frac{1}{\frac{1}{x^{2}\mathrm{e}^{2x}}+\left(1+\mathrm{e}^{-x}\right)^{2}}
=\frac{1}{0+1}=1.
$$

